{"id":"99bf2912-77d5-49a2-8d9e-8eedee30d193","slug":"ig30rps01","model":"IG30RPS01","name":"IG30RPS01 模拟ORP电极","shortDescription":"用于水处理及过程监测的模拟ORP电极，采用铂金测量元件与双盐桥参比结构。提供样品和标液校准方式，配套安装支架与流通池，便于现场安装及日常测量。","featured":false,"category":{"slug":"water","brand":null,"name":"水质分析","description":null,"seo":{"title":"水质分析","description":null,"imageUrl":null,"index":true}},"heroImage":{"id":"7507b7cd-7dc3-42b2-90a4-f843106d4461","kind":"IMAGE","originalName":"2025040859520101.png","mimeType":"image/jpeg","size":19079,"sha256":"7dfe5452c927d26232963ff85f11073f15b9d29010abcb394bea3ce0f2f502d6","width":358,"height":302,"url":"/igenu-preview/media/7dfe5452c927d26232963ff8.jpg","createdAt":"2026-10-20T17:32:39.754Z","variants":[{"width":320,"height":270,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/93a066c50a54638353b43bbf.webp"},{"width":358,"height":302,"mimeType":"image/webp","url":"/igenu-preview/media/b72cc265fa7500183b25c7da.webp"}]},"detailLayout":"STRUCTURED","availableLocales":["zh-CN","de","en"],"description":null,"bodyHtml":"<p><strong><span>产品特点：</span></strong></p><p>◆配置丰富，满足各种不同工况需求<strong></strong></p><p>◆内置温度传感器，自动温度补偿 </p><p>◆自动识别标液，一点样品校准 </p><p>◆传感器采用Ryton材料，使用寿命更长，降低维护与停机时间</p><p>◆大容量微孔双盐桥让探头抗毒性更强，使用寿命更长</p><p>◆大厚度高阻抗球泡，结构强度大，颗粒物撞击不易破损</p><p>◆超大铂金电极，提高了ORP电极的响应速度与耐污染能力</p><p>◆屏蔽壳体封装，不受环境电磁干扰</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>应用领域：</span></strong></p><p>地表水、市政污水、环境监测、工业过程控制、污染源、工业废水、自来水、生物制药、啤酒饮料、石油石化、冶金</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong><span>技术参数：</span></strong></p><p>测量范围：±1999mV；温度：-5-95℃</p><p>分辨率：0. 1 mV，0.1℃</p><p>准确度:± 0.5 mV</p><p>工作环境：0-95℃</p><p>响应时间:30秒达95%</p><p>最大压力:<span> 8.0bar</span></p><p>最大流速:3米/秒</p><p>校准方式:一点样品、一点标液校准</p><p>温度电极：PT1000</p><p>电极接口：BNC</p><p>参比电极：PTFE多孔盐桥液接</p><p>通讯接口：ModbusRS485</p><p>电极材质：PEEK、Ryton</p><p>螺纹接口：前后标准3/4NPT</p><p>防护等级：IP68</p><p>线缆长度：标准10m，可延长</p><p>电极尺寸：165mm*25mm</p><br />\n    ","gallery":[],"features":[],"specificationGroups":[{"name":"技术参数","specifications":[{"key":"measurement-range","label":"测量范围","value":"±1999mV；温度：-5-95℃","unit":null},{"key":"resolution","label":"分辨率","value":"0. 1 mV，0.1℃","unit":null},{"key":"accuracy","label":"准确度","value":"± 0.5 mV","unit":null},{"key":"operating-temperature","label":"工作环境","value":"0-95℃","unit":null},{"key":"response-time","label":"响应时间","value":"30秒达95%","unit":null},{"key":"maximum-pressure","label":"最大压力","value":"8.0bar","unit":null},{"key":"maximum-flow","label":"最大流速","value":"3米/秒","unit":null},{"key":"calibration","label":"校准方式","value":"一点样品、一点标液校准","unit":null},{"key":"temperature-electrode","label":"温度电极","value":"PT1000","unit":null},{"key":"electrode-interface","label":"电极接口","value":"BNC","unit":null},{"key":"reference-electrode","label":"参比电极","value":"PTFE多孔盐桥液接","unit":null},{"key":"digital-communication","label":"通讯接口","value":"ModbusRS485","unit":null},{"key":"electrode-material","label":"电极材质","value":"PEEK、Ryton","unit":null},{"key":"thread","label":"螺纹接口","value":"前后标准3/4NPT","unit":null},{"key":"protection","label":"防护等级","value":"IP68","unit":null},{"key":"cable","label":"线缆长度","value":"标准10m，可延长","unit":null},{"key":"electrode-size","label":"电极尺寸","value":"165mm*25mm","unit":null}]}],"sourceReviews":[],"documents":[],"supportDownloads":[],"seo":{"title":"IG30RPS01 模拟ORP电极 | IGENU SCIENCE","description":"用于水处理及过程监测的模拟ORP电极，采用铂金测量元件与双盐桥参比结构。提供样品和标液校准方式，配套安装支架与流通池，便于现场安装及日常测量。","imageUrl":"/igenu-preview/media/7dfe5452c927d26232963ff8.jpg","index":true}}